    {"id": "fir_lowpass.hamming_21", "op": "fir_lowpass", "args": {"num_taps": 21, "cutoff": 100, "sample_rate": 1000}, "expected": [6.775681768672038e-19, -0.002122271148825392, -0.006325353991514175, -0.011611810377620992, -0.012354656748982363, -4.612276295816693e-18, 0.03177449755856727, 0.0814359075642177, 0.13749378170194332, 0.18212549038873477, 0.19916883010695968, 0.18212549038873477, 0.13749378170194332, 0.08143590756421772, 0.03177449755856728, -4.612276295816695e-18, -0.012354656748982366, -0.011611810377620995, -0.006325353991514177, -0.002122271148825392, 6.775681768672038e-19], "tol": {"abs": 1e-12, "rel": 0}, "source": "vectors/generators/fir.py (stdlib only): ideal response by Simpson integration of the brick-wall spectrum, times the symmetric hamming window from its definition, scaled to unit zero-phase gain at DC"},
